      <p><em>Last updated: September 15, 2026</em></p>

      <p>This Privacy Policy explains how {{ settings.business_name }} ("Uptown Car Wash," "we," "us," or "our"),
      located at {{ settings.full_address }}, collects, uses, and protects your information. It also contains the
      Terms &amp; Conditions of our Text Club (SMS) marketing program.</p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect information you provide directly to us, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Name, email address, and mobile phone number when you fill out a form, join our Text Club, or sign up for a membership</li>
        <li>Vehicle information (make, model, license plate) for membership and RFID tag administration</li>
        <li>Payment information, which is processed by our payment processor — we do not store full card numbers</li>
        <li>Basic website usage data (pages visited, device type) through Google Analytics</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To provide car wash, detailing, and membership services</li>
        <li>To process membership payments and manage your account</li>
        <li>To send you service notifications about your account or membership</li>
        <li>To send promotional offers and reminders by text message, but only if you have expressly opted in</li>
        <li>To improve our services and website</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="sms">Text Club (SMS) Program — Terms &amp; Conditions</h2>

      <h3>Program Description</h3>
      <p>Uptown Car Wash offers a recurring SMS marketing program ("Text Club"). Subscribers receive marketing
      messages including promotions, discounts, special offers, and service reminders at the mobile number they
      provide.</p>

      <h3>How to Join</h3>
      <p>You may join the Text Club by submitting the enrollment form on our
      <a href="/text-club/">Text Club enrollment page</a> or by providing your mobile number and consent in person
      at our location. By joining, you consent to receive recurring automated marketing text messages from
      Uptown Car Wash at the number provided. <strong>Consent is not a condition of any purchase.</strong>
      You must be 18 years of age or older and the account holder or authorized user of the mobile number
      you submit.</p>

      <h3>Message Frequency</h3>
      <p>Message frequency varies. You can expect approximately 2–8 messages/promotions per month.</p>

      <h3>Cost</h3>
      <p>Message and data rates may apply. Uptown Car Wash does not charge for the messages, but your mobile
      carrier's standard rates apply. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</p>

      <h3>How to Opt Out (STOP)</h3>
      <p>You may cancel at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong> to any message from us. You will receive a
      one-time confirmation that you have been unsubscribed, after which you will receive no further marketing
      messages. To rejoin, sign up again at any time.</p>

      <h3>How to Get Help (HELP)</h3>
      <p>Reply <strong>HELP</strong> to any message for assistance, or contact us at
      <a href="tel:{{ settings.phone_link }}">{{ settings.phone }}</a> or
      <a href="mailto:{{ settings.email }}">{{ settings.email }}</a>.</p>

      <h3>Supported Carriers</h3>
      <p>Carriers including AT&amp;T, Verizon Wireless, T-Mobile, Sprint, U.S. Cellular, Boost, MetroPCS, and
      others are supported. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</p>

      <h2 id="mobile-data">Sharing of Mobile Information</h2>
      <p><strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or
      promotional purposes.</strong> All of the above categories exclude text messaging originator opt-in data
      and consent; this information will not be shared with any third parties.</p>
      <p>We share the mobile numbers and message content you provide only with the service providers that
      operate the messaging platform on our behalf (for example, our car wash management software provider and
      its SMS delivery carrier), and only for the purpose of delivering the messages you asked to receive.
      Those providers are contractually prohibited from using your information for their own marketing.</p>

      <h2>Other Sharing of Information</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may disclose information when required by law, to protect
      our rights or the safety of others, or to payment processors and service vendors who need it to perform
      services for us.</p>

      <h2>Data Security and Retention</h2>
      <p>We use reasonable administrative and technical safeguards to protect your information, and we retain it
      only as long as needed to provide our services or as required by law. No method of transmission over the
      internet is completely secure.</p>

      <h2>Your Choices and California Privacy Rights</h2>
      <p>You may opt out of marketing text messages at any time by replying STOP. California residents may
      request access to, correction of, or deletion of the personal information we hold about them, and may
      request that we not sell it (we do not sell personal information). To exercise any of these rights,
      contact us using the information below.</p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Our services are not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect information from
      them.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date above reflects the most
      recent revision.</p>

